  "design": {
    "idea": "Safe silk-spool primer: rotate a Blue Transformer to freeze a counterweight cable blue, hoisting the center bridge; step clear of a blooming thorn-wall and shoot yellow at the east spool so silk-fire blooms the north bridge and lights the shutter brazier.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ki",
    "teaches": "Blue light freezes silk_loom_spool (hoisting bridges); yellow light sends a conducting fire spark along linked threads to bloom light_plants and ignite braziers.",
    "decisions": 5,
    "expert_s": 42,
    "reward": "ws_loom+r2_access",
    "why": "Entry Carding Hall anchoring Waystone 1 and both dungeon return shortcuts (r8 zip-cable, r10 lift).",
